raging every 25.0 hours, demand centered around 2190281.0 units with variability of 463874.0 units, and a customer lead time fixed at 25.0 hours. If demand exceeds what is available, the business ships what it can and loses the remainder. The selling price is $2643.234 per unit, and customer payment comes 87.0 days later. Network-wise, both GlassCore Ltd. and MetalFab Inc. connect into Main Factory, and finished medical_device units move from Main Factory to Logistics Center. The model runs for 200 hours in total, with results collected after a 50-hour warm-up period, across 5 replications.

