here the bonding process turns plastic_pellet into SoC in exactly 5.0 days. Finished stock starts quite high: 702725 units of industrial_sensor and 869673 units of SoC. The industrial_sensor inventory is reviewed every 1 day and carries a shortage penalty of $25.966 per unit, while SoC is also reviewed every 1 day with a shortage cost of $11.383 per unit. On the demand side, Bosch Automotive buys industrial_sensor, with orders arriving at an average interval of 39.0 days and each order fixed at 1834806.0 units. Customers wait if stock is unavailable, and delivery to Bosch Automotive takes between 16.0 days and 29.0 days. The selling price is $2546.747 per unit, and payment is received between 25.0 days and 81.0 days later. Ross Associates purchases SoC, with demand arrivals averaging 44.0 days and order sizes ranging from 2082262.0 units to 2783100.0 units. That business also runs on a backorder basis, shipment lead time is between 5.0 days and 25.0 days, the sales price is $1986.617 per unit, and payment comes exactly 16.0 days after delivery. The model runs for 730 days, with the first 50 days treated as warm-up, and it is replicated 5 times.

