price to NXP Semiconductors is $3033.316 per unit, and payment is received 46.0 days after delivery. Bosch Automotive also buys medical_device, with orders arriving between 23.0 days and 29.0 days, demand between 1967024.0 units and 3481861.0 units, and customer lead time between 6.0 days and 19.0 days. For Bosch Automotive, available units are shipped immediately and the remainder is backordered. The selling price there is $1190.647 per unit, with customer payment collected after 34.0 days. Structurally, ChipCo and FastChip Corp. feed the Fab with raw materials, and the Fab sends medical_device to the Logistics Center. The model runs over 200 days, with the first 50 days excluded from results, and it is repeated 10 times.

