ys up for an average of 52.835 hours, and when it fails it is down for exactly 31.197 hours. Once produced, SoC units are sent from Main Factory to the Fulfillment Hub. On the demand side, Sony Electronics places orders for SoC at intervals between 22.0 hours and 33.0 hours, each order being a constant 3808664.0 units. Customer orders are delivered in exactly 21.0 hours, any unmet demand is backordered rather than lost, the selling price is $379.643 per unit, and payment is received 57.0 hours later. The model runs in hours over a 500-hour horizon with 10 replications.

