ip immediately while the remainder is backordered. ABB Industrial orders the same product with arrivals averaging 18.0 weeks apart and a fixed order size of 1284674.0 units. Its delivery promise is between 13.0 weeks and 14.0 weeks, the selling price is $4039.197 per unit, and payment is received after 73.0 weeks; under shortages, whatever is available is shipped and the rest of the sale is lost. Structurally, ChipCo, NanoMaterials Inc., and SiliconWorks all feed Assembly Hub, and Assembly Hub sends EV_battery output to Fulfillment Hub. The model runs in weeks over a 500-week horizon, with results collected after a 30-week warm-up period and 1 replication.

