y review every 1 day. Demand comes from two customers. HP Enterprise places orders for drones at intervals between 33.0 days and 52.0 days, with demand roughly 4181379.0 units on average and variability of 476800.0 units. Their delivery expectation is between 14.0 days and 25.0 days, the selling price is $3016.894 per unit, payment is received between 17.0 days and 72.0 days, and if stock is unavailable the sale is simply lost. Infineon Technologies orders exactly every 11.0 days, with demand centered around 4375321.0 units and varying by about 285555.0 units. Their requested lead time is between 3.0 days and 12.0 days, the sales price is $1361.787 per unit, and payment comes exactly 79.0 days later; if inventory is short, available units ship immediately and the balance is backordered. The model runs for a horizon of 365 days, with the first 50 days treated as warm-up, and 10 replications are used.

