s 10.0 days after delivery. Bosch Automotive buys router on a slower rhythm, with orders arriving every 47.0 days and demand averaging 1015955.0 units with variability of 281855.0 units. Router shipments reach the customer in 14.0 days, available stock is shipped and the rest of the demand is lost, the sales price is $211.691 per unit, and customer payment lands between 43.0 and 62.0 days later. The network links Process Go. and MetalFab Inc. to Main Factory, and Main Factory to Warehouse, and the whole scenario is evaluated over a 500-day horizon with 10 replications.

