ays, pays at $3247.609 per unit, and settles invoices in 39.0 to 63.0 days; if supply is short, available units are shipped and the rest of the sale is lost. Broadcom Limited orders EV_battery every 24.0 to 35.0 days, with demand centered around 997579.0 units and varying by about 142088.0 units, accepts delivery in 5.0 to 17.0 days, pays $218.186 per unit, and remits payment in 34.0 to 82.0 days; if stock is insufficient, available units go out immediately and the balance is backordered. The network therefore links 3 suppliers—NanoMaterials Inc., SiliconWorks, and PolymerSource—to 2 facilities, Assembly Hub and Warehouse, and the model is run over a 500-day horizon with 5 replications.

