ove from the Processing Unit to the Distribution Center, which acts as the warehouse in this network. Customer demand comes from ABB Industrial, with orders arriving somewhere between 26.0 days and 33.0 days, each for exactly 1363303.0 units. Delivery to the customer takes between 7.0 days and 17.0 days, and the business follows a partial backorder approach, meaning available units ship right away and the remainder waits until stock is replenished. EV_battery sells at $2060.513 per unit, and ABB Industrial pays 19.0 days after receipt. The network links Process Go. and GlobalComponents to the Processing Unit, then routes EV_battery onward to the Distribution Center, and the model is evaluated over a 200-day horizon with 5 replications.

