r fixed at 3186915.0 units; shipments are promised in 16.0 weeks, the selling price is $4811.905 per unit, payment comes 66.0 days later, and if stock is unavailable the sale is lost. Bosch Automotive also purchases routers, ordering every 49.0 weeks, with demand ranging from 2288535.0 units to 3161587.0 units; its delivery commitment runs between 13.0 weeks and 23.0 weeks, the sales price is $3192.593 per unit, receivables are collected in 35.0 days to 75.0 days, and any shortfall is backordered. The model runs for 500 weeks, with results collected after a 50 week warm-up period, across 5 replications.

