age cost of $34.918 per unit. Finished goods start with 1701331 units of solar_panel inventory, reviewed every 1 week, with a holding cost of $6.454 per unit. Customer demand comes from HP Enterprise, with orders arriving at an average interval of 23.0 weeks, each order fixed at 2952980.0 units. Delivery to the customer takes exactly 25.0 weeks, the selling price is $2557.312 per unit, and customer payments are received between 9.0 days and 17.0 days later. If stock is unavailable, the sale is simply lost. The model runs for 730 weeks, with the first 50 weeks treated as warm-up, and 5 replications are used.

