nd side, Broadcom Limited buys industrial_sensor units, placing orders somewhere between every 28.0 days and 43.0 days, with demand around 4630953.0 units on average and variability of 595530.0 units. Customer deliveries take between 10.0 days and 13.0 days, any unfilled demand is backordered, the selling price is $4432.575 per unit, and customer payment arrives between 39.0 days and 73.0 days. The model connects SiliconWorks, BatteryTech, and Memory Star to Advanced Fab, and then routes industrial_sensor units from Advanced Fab to the Fulfillment Hub, over a planning horizon of 100 days with 10 replications.

