d between 25.0 days and 36.0 days later. TechCorp orders every 22.0 hours for 697480.0 units, accepts delivery in anywhere from 4.0 hours to 22.0 hours, and pays $4869.275 per unit, also under a partial-fulfillment lost-sales arrangement; cash is collected exactly 10.0 days after delivery. The model runs for a horizon of 365 hours, with the first 50 hours treated as warm-up, and 10 replications are used.

