ek lead time at $436.684 per unit, with invoices settled in 39.0 to 48.0 days, while GlobalComponents offers the same material in exactly 1.0 week at $10.043 per unit, on 13.0-day payment terms, and can supply up to 283710 units per delivery. Ceramic_substrate comes either from SiliconWorks, whose lead time is exponential with a mean of 1.0 week, charging $15.206 per unit with payment due in 49.0 to 59.0 days and a maximum order size of 126767 units, or from PolymerSource, which delivers in exactly 28.0 weeks at $231.203 per unit, allows 40.0 to 52.0 days to pay, can supply up to 354289 units per order, and takes 5.0 weeks to transfer material to Advanced Fab. Production at Advanced Fab is built around an inspection step that consumes ceramic_substrate, cooling_unit, glass_fiber, and solder_paste and turns them into laptops. That step runs on the Welding Station, with a fixed cycle of 27.0 weeks per job. The Welding Station has capacity for 3 units at a time, works with service times ranging from 0.264 to 7.171 weeks, and uses batching, grouping work into lots of 50 units with a maximum wait of 9.711 weeks before processing. It is not perfectly reliable either: uptime lasts 71.511 weeks flat, followed by 18.773 weeks of downtime, and it costs $13.24 per week to operate. A Packaging Machine is also part of the setup, with capacity for 5 units, a steady 5.556-week processing time, and an operating cost of $13.162 per week. On the demand side, Bosch Automotive buys laptops, placing orders at intervals between 17.0 and 39.0 weeks, with each order fixed at 642826.0 units. Customer lead time runs between 17.0 and 19.0 weeks. If stock is short, available units are shipped immediately and the remainder is backordered. The selling price is $3565.172 per unit, and customer payment comes 66.0 days after delivery. In terms of network structure, the suppliers GlassCore Ltd., PrecisionParts, SiliconWorks, FastChip Corp., GlobalComponents, and PolymerSource feed the facilities Advanced Fab and Regional Depot, and laptops move from Advanced Fab to Regional Depot. The model runs in weeks over a 100-week horizon, with results collected after a 30-week warm-up period and evaluated across 10 replications.

