artial fulfillment with backorder for the remainder. GPUs are sold at $2732.98 per unit, and Dell Technologies pays 51.0 hours after delivery. The modeled network links all 8 suppliers to the 2 facilities, and the run covers 500 hours with a 50-hour warm-up period; 10 replications are included.

