rehouse with immediate transfer. On the demand side, ABB Industrial buys industrial_sensor with order arrivals averaging every 25 days, and each order falls between 2086638 units and 3131086 units. Customer delivery is a fixed 6 days, unmet demand is backordered, the selling price is $2755.624 per unit, and payment is received 70 days later. Bosch Automotive purchases router with orders arriving between 15 days and 36 days, quantities ranging from 758229 units to 870921 units, and delivery promised in 16 days to 28 days. For router sales, available stock is shipped and the remainder is lost, the price is $4146.137 per unit, and customer payment comes between 52 days and 64 days. Overall, all 7 suppliers feed the Processing Unit and Warehouse network, and the model runs over a 730-day horizon with 10 replications.

