raging 17.0 weeks, demand around 2148155.0 units with variability of 115550.0 units, customer lead time somewhere between 17.0 weeks and 29.0 weeks, a backorder policy when stock is short, a selling price of $2975.825 per unit, and payment terms ranging from 12.0 weeks to 86.0 weeks. The model runs over a 500-week horizon.

