ivery, unmet demand is backordered, the selling price is $1155.077 per unit, and Apple Supply pays 37 days after delivery. TechCorp orders drones with an exponential interarrival time averaging 45 weeks, demand ranges from 1956188.0 units to 3744954.0 units, delivery takes 23 weeks, and if product is unavailable the sale is lost; these units sell at $3516.633 per unit and payment comes 58 days after delivery. Lenovo Group orders more frequently, with arrivals averaging 27 weeks, and demand is approximately 523067.0 units with variability of 152483.0 units. Its lead time is exactly 3 weeks, available stock is shipped while the remainder is lost, the price is $3875.856 per unit, and payment is received after 56 days. The model runs for 200 weeks, with results collected after a warm-up period of 30 weeks, and 1 replication is used.

